e\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq\">\\(\\subseteq\\)</span> (inclusion order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6AntichainFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb6AntichainFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6SpernerFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb6SpernerFamily}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6AntichainFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\land\\;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to(A\\not\\subseteq B\\;\\land\\;B\\not\\subseteq A))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6AntichainFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\land\\;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to(A\\not\\subseteq B\\;\\land\\;B\\not\\subseteq A))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}sperner\\text{-}family\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6SpernerFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb6AntichainFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}sperner\\text{-}family\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6SpernerFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb6AntichainFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC combinatorial definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-comb6-sperner-family</code> is merged here; Sperner family and inclusion-antichain family are the same condition.</li>\n<li>The compatibility alias has its own assertion label.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-antichain","status":"resolved","id":"b98049bc73009c64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-antichain]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-family","status":"resolved","id":"545b51e7aa011030","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-family","status":"resolved","id":"545b51e7aa011030","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)$ (family of subsets, see [[58-df-family]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\subseteq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6AntichainFamily}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6SpernerFamily}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6AntichainFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\land\\;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to(A\\not\\subseteq B\\;\\land\\;B\\not\\subseteq A))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}sperner\\text{-}family\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6SpernerFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb6AntichainFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)","display":true}],"byt